---

<BaseLayout
  title="Sarah & the Buds"
  description="Sarah & the Buds (full band) and the Sarah & Bud acoustic duo: live music for weddings, wineries, festivals, and parties around Lexington and Midway, Kentucky."
  ogImage="/images/music/facebook/sarah-and-buds-cover-band.jpg"
  ogImageAlt="Sarah & the Buds performing together as a full band."
  structuredData={musicGroupSchema}
>
  <div class="page-container music-page">
    <div class="page-content text-container">
      <div class="brand-intro"><img class="brand-mark" src="/images/brand/sb-mark.png" alt="S&B microphone mark" width="1124" height="797" /><h1>Sarah &amp; the Buds</h1></div>
      <p class="lede">
        <strong>Sarah &amp; the Buds</strong> is a full band built for singing
        along. <strong>Sarah &amp; Bud</strong> is the acoustic duo version of
        the same thing, for smaller rooms and porches.
      </p>

      <div class="music-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/shows">Upcoming shows</a>
        <a
          class="button button-secondary"
          href="mailto:booksarahandbud@gmail.com?subject=Booking%20inquiry"
          >Book the band</a
        >
      </div>

      <nav class="music-sections" aria-label="Music page sections">
        <p>On this page</p>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#band-and-duo">Band &amp; duo</a></li>
          <li><a href="#where-we-play">Where we play</a></li>
          <li><a href="#photos">Photos</a></li>
          <li><a href="#songbook">Songbook</a></li>
          <li><a href="#originals">Originals</a></li>
          <li><a href="#holidays">Holidays</a></li>
          <li><a href="#follow-along">Follow along</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="music-hero">
      <div class="image-frame">
        <img
          src="/images/music/sarah-and-the-buds-band-only-hero.webp"
          width="1542" height="1020" fetchpriority="high"
          alt="The four members of Sarah & the Buds smiling together against a dark background."
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-content text-container">
      <p>
        The set list is familiar and fun: rock, country, Americana, folk, and
        pop you already know, played so people can sing along. Woven through it
        are the band's own originals, which are as much a part of a night as
        the covers.
      </p>

      <h2 id="band-and-duo" tabindex="-1">The band and the duo</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Sarah &amp; the Buds</strong> is the full-band experience, with
        more sound and more energy for a bigger room or event. <strong
          >Sarah &amp; Bud</strong
        > is the acoustic duo.
      </p>

      <div class="introduction-photos">
        {introductions.map((photo) => (
          <figure>
            <img src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt} width={photo.width} height={photo.height} loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </figure>
        ))}
      </div>

      <h2 id="where-we-play" tabindex="-1">Where they play</h2>
      <p>Sarah &amp; the Buds and Sarah &amp; Bud are available for:</p>
      <ul class="booking-contexts">
        {bookingContexts.map((c) => <li>{c}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <p>
        Booking pricing is available on request. To check a date or ask about a
        show, email <a href="mailto:booksarahandbud@gmail.com?subject=Booking%20inquiry"
          >booksarahandbud@gmail.com</a
        >.
      </p>
    </div>

    <section aria-labelledby="photos">
      <h2 id="photos" tabindex="-1">Photos</h2>
      <div class="photo-gallery">
        {[...gallery, ...newPhotos].map((photo) => (
          <div class="image-frame">
            <img src={photo.src} alt={photo.alt}
              width={"width" in photo ? photo.width : undefined}
              height={"height" in photo ? photo.height : undefined}
              loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="page-content text-container">
      <h2 id="songbook" tabindex="-1">A taste of the songbook</h2>
      <p>
        Explore selections from our songbook, organized by artist. Expand an artist to see more songs.
        Sarah &amp; the Buds also take requests; if you have a song in mind for
        your event, just ask.
      </p>
      <details class="songbook-panel">
        <summary>Browse the songbook <span>({coversByArtist.reduce((count, artist) => count + artist.songs.length, 0)} songs · {coversByArtist.length} artists)</span></summary>
        <ul class="repertoire">
          {coversByArtist.map((entry) => (
            <li>
              {entry.songs.length > 1 ? (
                <details class="artist-songs">
                  <summary>{entry.artist} <span>({entry.songs.length} songs)</span></summary>
                  <ul>{entry.songs.map((song) => <li>{song}</li>)}</ul>
                </details>
              ) : (
                <><span class="repertoire-artist">{entry.artist}</span><span class="repertoire-songs">{entry.songs[0]}</span></>
              )}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </details>

      <h2 id="originals" tabindex="-1">Originals</h2>
      <p>
        The band writes and performs its own songs, more than forty of them,
        as a real part of the act, not an afterthought. A few:
      </p>
      <ul class="repertoire repertoire--originals">
        {originals.map((o) => <li>{o}</li>)}
      </ul>

      <h2 id="holidays" tabindex="-1">Holidays</h2>
      <p>
        For December bookings, the set makes room for Christmas favorites,
        from "Feliz Navidad" to "Fairytale of New York," alongside Bud's
        original holiday song, "Merry Mary."
      </p>

      <h2 id="follow-along" tabindex="-1">Follow along</h2>
      <p>
        See and hear more on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sarah.and.bud/"
          >Instagram</a
        >, <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@sarahandbud">YouTube</a>, and <a
          href="https://www.facebook.com/sarahandbud">Facebook</a
        >.
      </p>

      <p>
        <a href="/shows">See upcoming shows &rarr;</a>
      </p>

      <p>
        <a class="button button-primary" href="mailto:booksarahandbud@gmail.com?subject=Booking%20inquiry"
          >Email Sarah &amp; Bud booking</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .songbook-panel { margin-block: 24px; border-block: 1px solid var(--color-muted); }
  .songbook-panel summary { cursor: pointer; padding-block: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .songbook-panel summary span { font-size: var(--text-small); font-weight: 400; }
  .songbook-panel summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid currentColor; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .artist-songs { width: 100%; }
  .artist-songs summary { padding-block: 8px; min-height: 44px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .artist-songs ul { padding-left: 24px; margin-block: 0 12px; }
  .artist-songs li { display: list-item; border: 0; padding: 4px 0; }

  .introduction-photos {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    margin-block: 24px 32px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .introduction-photos figure { margin: 0; min-width: 0; }
  .introduction-photos img {
    display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover; object-position: center; border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .photo-gallery { columns: 3; column-gap: 16px; }
  .photo-gallery .image-frame { break-inside: avoid; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .photo-gallery img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .photo-gallery { columns: 2; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .introduction-photos { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .photo-gallery { columns: 1; }
  }

  .music-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
  }

  .music-actions .button {
    padding-inline: var(--space-3);
  }

  .music-sections {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    border-block: 1px solid var(--color-muted);
  }

  .music-sections p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-small);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .music-sections ul {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0 var(--space-3);
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .music-sections a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding-block: var(--space-2);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  /* Leave room for a wrapped header if it becomes sticky. Native fragment
     navigation stays instant, including with reduced-motion preferences. */
  h2[id] {
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--space-8) + var(--space-5));
  }

  h2[id]:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }
</style>
